    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164500/extras/19545e929d3accfcf45a34586361146d.poster.avif?t=1754599833\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164500/extras/19545e929d3accfcf45a34586361146d.webm?t=1754599833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164500/extras/19545e929d3accfcf45a34586361146d.mp4?t=1754599833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>99 Fails is an impossibly difficult arcade platformer set in Zeebo's surreal nightmare with bizarre monsters, set to music by David Wise!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164500/extras/9c4fb215402b31f94c2409736833232a.avif?t=1754599833\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164500/extras/c4ec811a457122fa4a054c00b7d1c132.webp?t=1754599833\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Work your way through 8 floors of specific challenges of Zeebo's Mental Museum and unlock his origin story. Meet weird characters, find yourself in absurd events, as your beating the each floor's challenges unlocks a comic page for you to read.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164500/extras/a0b556c52a4a194245df52d3091d61dc.avif?t=1754599833\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164500/extras/e7f2f4037845105d614c34e8f89d0714.avif?t=1754599833\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Skill-Based Challenges:</strong> Try fast-paced trials built around mechanics like dashing, wall-jumping, and Smash-style target breaking and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Compete Online:</strong> Join frantic PvP races\u00a0 \u2014 beat friends and rivals on global leaderboards.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164500/extras/32436617d758db68a7a63a229c89bb9a.avif?t=1754599833\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endless Mode:</strong> Enter an endless multiplayer run where only the top 3 survive at each checkpoint. Last as long as you can for fame and glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164500/extras/57f679ab1eab4b23494a0456b5e6559f.poster.avif?t=1754599833\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164500/extras/57f679ab1eab4b23494a0456b5e6559f.webm?t=1754599833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164500/extras/57f679ab1eab4b23494a0456b5e6559f.mp4?t=1754599833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164500/extras/0b22b2b7dce237b2308651dd6ae53867.avif?t=1754599833\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Neebota</strong> is a new fantasy universe where beings wrestle with hope, fear, dreams, and self-discovery. Its dreamworld, <strong>Noobota</strong>, reflects the minds of its inhabitants \u2014 twisted, beautiful, and layered with meaning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>99 Fails</strong> is developed by indie studio <strong>Frying Jelly</strong> with a focus on building original IP and immersive worlds you can get lost in, with Neebota: Zeebo's Awakening being the first grand adventure-RPG title scheduled for 2026!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164500/extras/19545e929d3accfcf45a34586361146d.poster.avif?t=1754599833\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164500/extras/19545e929d3accfcf45a34586361146d.webm?t=1754599833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164500/extras/19545e929d3accfcf45a34586361146d.mp4?t=1754599833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>99 Fails is an impossibly difficult arcade platformer set in Zeebo's surreal nightmare with bizarre monsters, set to music by David Wise!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164500/extras/9c4fb215402b31f94c2409736833232a.avif?t=1754599833\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164500/extras/c4ec811a457122fa4a054c00b7d1c132.webp?t=1754599833\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Work your way through 8 floors of specific challenges of Zeebo's Mental Museum and unlock his origin story. Meet weird characters, find yourself in absurd events, as your beating the each floor's challenges unlocks a comic page for you to read.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164500/extras/a0b556c52a4a194245df52d3091d61dc.avif?t=1754599833\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164500/extras/e7f2f4037845105d614c34e8f89d0714.avif?t=1754599833\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Skill-Based Challenges:</strong> Try fast-paced trials built around mechanics like dashing, wall-jumping, and Smash-style target breaking and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Compete Online:</strong> Join frantic PvP races\u00a0 \u2014 beat friends and rivals on global leaderboards.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164500/extras/32436617d758db68a7a63a229c89bb9a.avif?t=1754599833\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endless Mode:</strong> Enter an endless multiplayer run where only the top 3 survive at each checkpoint. Last as long as you can for fame and glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164500/extras/57f679ab1eab4b23494a0456b5e6559f.poster.avif?t=1754599833\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164500/extras/57f679ab1eab4b23494a0456b5e6559f.webm?t=1754599833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164500/extras/57f679ab1eab4b23494a0456b5e6559f.mp4?t=1754599833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164500/extras/0b22b2b7dce237b2308651dd6ae53867.avif?t=1754599833\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Neebota</strong> is a new fantasy universe where beings wrestle with hope, fear, dreams, and self-discovery. Its dreamworld, <strong>Noobota</strong>, reflects the minds of its inhabitants \u2014 twisted, beautiful, and layered with meaning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>99 Fails</strong> is developed by indie studio <strong>Frying Jelly</strong> with a focus on building original IP and immersive worlds you can get lost in, with Neebota: Zeebo's Awakening being the first grand adventure-RPG title scheduled for 2026!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
